header: "---\nname: jake-linkedin-li-repurpose\ndescription: \"Turn one long asset - a YouTube video, podcast, newsletter, blog post, transcript or client call - into a week of LinkedIn posts. Use when the user says \\\"repurpose this\\\", \\\"turn this into posts\\\", \\\"I have a video/newsletter/ transcript\\\", or pastes a long piece of content and wants it on LinkedIn.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/linkedin-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: li-repurpose\n  upstream_commit: add2c23882fe79180737d242ff80a5da205eda6a\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
